# Tailwind

## Mobile first (required)

Write the mobile style first. Then `md:` / `lg:`. Never write desktop first.

```tsx
className="mt-16 px-5 md:mt-44 md:px-8"
className="flex flex-col md:flex-row"
className="text-2xl md:text-5xl"
className="block lg:hidden"
className="hidden lg:block"
```

In the DOM, put the mobile block first when both exist. Then the desktop block with `hidden lg:block`.

Header / dense nav: use the hamburger through tablet. Full desktop nav starts at `lg` (1024px), not `md` (768px). Footer grids: `1` → `sm:2` → `lg:4`.

## Prefer short utilities

Use the normal Tailwind scale first: `text-sm`, `text-base`, `text-lg`, `text-xl`, `px-4`, `py-2`, `gap-3`, `rounded-full`, `shadow-md`, `font-light`, `font-medium`.

Keep each `className` short and readable. Do not stack long chains.

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT
className="px-4 py-2 text-lg text-white"
className="mt-4 text-2xl font-medium text-white md:text-5xl"

// ❌ WRONG — long, hard to read
className="relative px-2 py-1 text-[0.875rem] font-[300] text-white before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-1 before:h-[90%] before:w-px before:bg-white"
```

Do not invent a class constant just to hide a long string. Shorten the classes instead.

Do not use `before:` / `after:` tricks when a real element works (`|` divider, a `span`, a `border-b`).

## Arbitrary values only when needed

Use `[...]` only when the design needs an exact rem, rgba, gradient, or shadow that the scale cannot match.

```tsx
className="w-[25.313rem]"
className="text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]"
className="bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(242,240,245,0)_0%,#F2F0F5_100%)]"
```

If `text-lg` or `px-5` is close enough, use that.

Color opacity goes in the color (`text-white/60` or `text-[rgba(...)]`). Do not use `opacity-60` on a parent.

## Sections

New sections are plain elements plus Tailwind. Do not wrap them in `FadeInSection`. Do not add Framer Motion or an intersection observer for a simple reveal.

```tsx
<section className="mx-8 mt-16 px-5 py-20 md:mx-[4.5rem] md:mt-44 md:px-[4.5rem]">
  <h2 className="text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight">...</h2>
  <p className="mt-10 text-white/60">...</p>
</section>
```

## Do not

- No long unreadable `className` strings when short utilities work
- No `px` in class values (`w-[400px]` → `w-96` or rem)
- No desktop-first order
- No random off-scale spacing
- No static `style={{}}` when a Tailwind class exists
- No new per-component CSS file
- No class-constant wrappers used only to hide long Tailwind
